ns to do so. The story missions are good and zones can be replayed. The horizontal gear progression is fun and does not put a lot of pressure to stay up to date. It's both excellent if you play it a lot and if you only play a little. As you might see, I have played the game for over a 1000 hours and I still have not completed everything. There is also plenty of changes and new content constantly coming so I think there are good odds of me playing it for many years to come.", "timestamp_created": 1664580414, "timestamp_updated": 1664580414, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "123105944", "author": {"steamid": "76561199199572230", "personaname": "CommunistKnight", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199199572230/", "num_games_owned": 8, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 19229, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6838, "last_played": 1708825390, "avatar": "e9f1eee5d36319a62f34ce240d9084b8f4995fda"}, "language": "english", "review": "Clem", "timestamp_created": 1664580157, "timestamp_updated": 1664580157, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "123103237", "author": {"steamid": "76561199255618132", "personaname": "CalebWalkin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199255618132/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 230, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 228, "last_played":